        {
            "id": "https://ruyunjian.github.io/2026/10/04/rain-island/",
            "url": "https://ruyunjian.github.io/2026/10/04/rain-island/",
            "title": "Rain Island：用 Three.js 复现雨天的 3D 降水场景",
            "date_published": "2026-10-04T04:00:00.000Z",
            "content_html": "<link rel=\"stylesheet\" class=\"aplayer-secondary-style-marker\" href=\"\\assets\\css\\APlayer.min.css\"><script src=\"\\assets\\js\\APlayer.min.js\" class=\"aplayer-secondary-script-marker\"></script><script class=\"meting-secondary-script-marker\" src=\"\\assets\\js\\Meting.min.js\"></script><p>Rain Island 是我做的一个 Windows 降雨提醒项目。我想把天气预报中的数字变成能直接看懂的画面：雨从什么时候开始、雨势如何增强、又怎样逐渐减弱，都可以在一段三维雨景里看到。</p>\n<p>这篇文章记录其中最主要的部分——用 Three.js 和 GLSL 复现雨天的降水场景。下面的图片和交互预览均来自项目原始渲染代码，使用模拟降水数据。</p>\n<p><img src=\"/rain-island/assets/rain-preview.webp\" alt=\"Rain Island 原始代码实际渲染的雨丝、地面涟漪和弹起水滴\"></p>\n<p><span id=\"more\"></span></p>\n<h2 id=\"实际-3d-预览\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#实际-3d-预览\">#</a> 实际 3D 预览</h2>\n<p>可以切换小雨、中雨、大雨，拖动时间轴观察同一场雨的强弱变化，也可以点击“环绕镜头”从不同方向观看。点击“播放过程”，会用约 15 秒播放完整的模拟降雨过程。</p>\n<p>\n<iframe src=\"/rain-island/\" title=\"Rain Island 实际 3D 雨景交互预览（模拟数据）\" loading=\"lazy\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-top-navigation-by-user-activation allow-downloads\" style=\"width:100%;height:1040px;border:0;border-radius:16px;display:block;\"></iframe>\n</p>\n<p><a href=\"/rain-island/\">独立打开 3D 预览</a> · <a href=\"/rain-island/assets/rain-scene.js\">下载原始雨景渲染代码</a></p>\n<p>预览只在浏览器本地运行，不查询真实天气，不请求定位。页面不包含实际地点、经纬度、个人天气接口地址、密钥或观测记录。</p>\n<h2 id=\"项目介绍\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#项目介绍\">#</a> 项目介绍</h2>\n<p>桌面版使用 Electron 承载透明置顶窗口，以胶囊展开的方式显示雨景、降水时间轴和提醒信息。Three.js 负责三维场景，GLSL 着色器负责雨丝下落、涟漪扩散以及水滴弹起的动画。雨声则是另一个独立模块，桌面版支持程序合成雨声与自选录音。</p>\n<p>这次博客展示只提取雨景渲染层。原项目的桌面窗口、天气服务连接、设置存储和雨声模块没有打包进网页，访客无需安装桌面程序即可查看模型效果。</p>\n<p>这里的“3D 模型”是通过代码生成的场景：没有加载现成的雨景模型文件，也没有用 GIF 或视频代替三维渲染。雨丝是线段，涟漪是实例化平面，弹起的水滴是点精灵，透视相机提供空间深度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"场景怎样组成\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#场景怎样组成\">#</a> 场景怎样组成</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景层</th>\n<th>实现方式</th>\n<th>主要作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>雨丝</td>\n<td><code>BufferGeometry</code> + <code>LineSegments</code></td>\n<td>在空间中生成下落线段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>湿润地面</td>\n<td>平面 + 自定义片元着色器</td>\n<td>表现受光区域与细碎水面高光</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>落地涟漪</td>\n<td><code>InstancedBufferGeometry</code></td>\n<td>批量生成不同位置、不同生命周期的扩散圆环</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>弹起水滴</td>\n<td><code>Points</code> + 点精灵着色器</td>\n<td>增加雨点落地后的细节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>透视镜头</td>\n<td><code>PerspectiveCamera</code></td>\n<td>产生远近关系，并实现真正的镜头环绕</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>默认上限是 6,000 条雨丝、2,300 个涟漪实例和 1,800 个弹起水滴。实际显示数量随雨势调整。它们是视觉效果参数，不对应真实世界某一平方米内的雨滴数量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心代码让降水强度驱动画面\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#核心代码让降水强度驱动画面\">#</a> 核心代码：让降水强度驱动画面</h2>\n<h3 id=\"1-从-mmh-映射到视觉强度\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#1-从-mmh-映射到视觉强度\">#</a> 1. 从 mm/h 映射到视觉强度</h3>\n<p>渲染层接收降水强度 <code>rate</code>，单位为 mm/h，再把它映射为 0～1 的视觉强度。非线性映射让小雨也有可见细节；随后用指数平滑避免雨势切换时画面突然跳变。</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-javascript\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#A0ADA0;--shiki-dark:#758575DD\">// RainScene.setRate(rate)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#C99076\">this</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">.</span><span style=\"color:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#BD976A\">target</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#BD976A\"> Math</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">.</span><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">min</span><span style=\"color:#2993a3;--shiki-dark:#5eaab5\">(</span><span style=\"color:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91\">1</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">,</span><span style=\"color:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#BD976A\"> Math</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">.</span><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">pow</span><span style=\"color:#1e754f;--shiki-dark:#4d9375\">(</span><span style=\"color:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#BD976A\">Math</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">.</span><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">max</span><span style=\"color:#a65e2b;--shiki-dark:#d4976c\">(</span><span style=\"color:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91\">0</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">,</span><span style=\"color:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#BD976A\"> rate</span><span style=\"color:#a65e2b;--shiki-dark:#d4976c\">)</span><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91\"> 16</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">,</span><span style=\"color:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91\"> .6</span><span style=\"color:#1e754f;--shiki-dark:#4d9375\">)</span><span style=\"color:#2993a3;--shiki-dark:#5eaab5\">)</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#A0ADA0;--shiki-dark:#758575DD\">// RainScene.render(dt)，dt 的单位是秒</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#C99076\">this</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">.</span><span style=\"color:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#BD976A\">intensity</span><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\"> +=</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\"> </span><span style=\"color:#2993a3;--shiki-dark:#5eaab5\">(</span><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#C99076\">this</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">.</span><span style=\"color:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#BD976A\">target</span><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#C99076\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">.</span><span style=\"color:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#BD976A\">intensity</span><span style=\"color:#2993a3;--shiki-dark:#5eaab5\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\">  *</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\"> </span><span style=\"color:#2993a3;--shiki-dark:#5eaab5\">(</span><span style=\"color:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91\">1</span><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#BD976A\"> Math</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">.</span><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">exp</span><span style=\"color:#1e754f;--shiki-dark:#4d9375\">(</span><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\">-</span><span style=\"color:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#BD976A\">dt</span><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91\"> 5</span><span style=\"color:#1e754f;--shiki-dark:#4d9375\">)</span><span style=\"color:#2993a3;--shiki-dark:#5eaab5\">)</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#C99076\">this</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">.</span><span style=\"color:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#BD976A\">uniforms</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">.</span><span style=\"color:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#BD976A\">uIntensity</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">.</span><span style=\"color:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#BD976A\">value</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#C99076\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">.</span><span style=\"color:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#BD976A\">intensity</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#C99076\">this</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">.</span><span style=\"color:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#BD976A\">rain</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">.</span><span style=\"color:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#BD976A\">geometry</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">.</span><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">setDrawRange</span><span style=\"color:#2993a3;--shiki-dark:#5eaab5\">(</span><span style=\"color:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91\">0</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">,</span><span style=\"color:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#BD976A\"> Math</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">.</span><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">round</span><span style=\"color:#1e754f;--shiki-dark:#4d9375\">(</span><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#C99076\">this</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">.</span><span style=\"color:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#BD976A\">intensity</span><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91\"> 6000</span><span style=\"color:#1e754f;--shiki-dark:#4d9375\">)</span><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#2993a3;--shiki-dark:#5eaab5\">)</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#C99076\">this</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">.</span><span style=\"color:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#BD976A\">splashes</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">.</span><span style=\"color:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#BD976A\">geometry</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">.</span><span style=\"color:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#BD976A\">instanceCount</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#BD976A\"> Math</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">.</span><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">round</span><span style=\"color:#2993a3;--shiki-dark:#5eaab5\">(</span><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#C99076\">this</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">.</span><span style=\"color:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#BD976A\">intensity</span><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91\"> 2300</span><span style=\"color:#2993a3;--shiki-dark:#5eaab5\">)</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#C99076\">this</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">.</span><span style=\"color:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#BD976A\">spray</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">.</span><span style=\"color:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#BD976A\">geometry</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">.</span><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">setDrawRange</span><span style=\"color:#2993a3;--shiki-dark:#5eaab5\">(</span><span style=\"color:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91\">0</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">,</span><span style=\"color:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#BD976A\"> Math</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">.</span><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">round</span><span style=\"color:#1e754f;--shiki-dark:#4d9375\">(</span><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#C99076\">this</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">.</span><span style=\"color:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#BD976A\">intensity</span><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91\"> 1800</span><span style=\"color:#1e754f;--shiki-dark:#4d9375\">)</span><span style=\"color:#2993a3;--shiki-dark:#5eaab5\">)</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">;</span></span></code></pre>\n<p>每条雨丝有两个顶点，因此雨丝的绘制顶点数需要乘以 2。涟漪和弹起水滴也使用同一个强度参数，保持场景整体一致。</p>\n<p>如果输入是五分钟累计降水量，换算到五分钟平均强度的关系是 <code>rate = amount × 60 / 5 = amount × 12</code>。这两种单位必须区分：累计量是 mm，强度是 mm/h。</p>\n<h3 id=\"2-在-gpu-上计算雨丝下落\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#2-在-gpu-上计算雨丝下落\">#</a> 2. 在 GPU 上计算雨丝下落</h3>\n<p>雨丝初始位置在 JavaScript 中一次性生成，每帧只更新时间等 uniform。下面节选自原始顶点着色器：</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-glsl\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\">vec3</span><span style=\"color:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\"> p </span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">=</span><span style=\"color:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\"> position</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\">float</span><span style=\"color:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\"> speed </span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">=</span><span style=\"color:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91\"> 8.5</span><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\"> seed </span><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\">*</span><span style=\"color:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91\"> 5.</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">p.y </span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">=</span><span style=\"color:#998418;--shiki-dark:#B8A965\"> mod</span><span style=\"color:#2993a3;--shiki-dark:#5eaab5\">(</span><span style=\"color:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">position.y </span><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\">-</span><span style=\"color:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\"> uTime </span><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\">*</span><span style=\"color:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\"> speed</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">,</span><span style=\"color:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91\"> 13.</span><span style=\"color:#2993a3;--shiki-dark:#5eaab5\">)</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">p.x </span><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\"> p.y </span><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\">*</span><span style=\"color:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91\"> .035</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\">vec4</span><span style=\"color:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\"> mv </span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">=</span><span style=\"color:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\"> modelViewMatrix </span><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\">*</span><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\"> vec4</span><span style=\"color:#2993a3;--shiki-dark:#5eaab5\">(</span><span style=\"color:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\">p</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">,</span><span style=\"color:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91\"> 1.</span><span style=\"color:#2993a3;--shiki-dark:#5eaab5\">)</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#998418;--shiki-dark:#B8A965\">gl_Position</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\"> projectionMatrix </span><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\">*</span><span style=\"color:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE\"> mv</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">;</span></span></code></pre>\n<p><code>seed</code> 给不同雨丝分配速度，<code>mod</code> 使雨丝落到底部后回到上方，轻微的横向偏移形成倾斜。相机矩阵再把三维坐标投影到屏幕，远近雨丝因此有不同的空间表现。</p>\n<h3 id=\"3-用实例化平面生成落地涟漪\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#3-用实例化平面生成落地涟漪\">#</a> 3. 用实例化平面生成落地涟漪</h3>\n<p>大量涟漪共用同一份平面几何体，每个实例只保存落点 <code>offset</code> 和相位 <code>phase</code>。顶点着色器决定扩散大小，片元着色器画出环形亮度并让它逐渐消失。</p>\n<pre 