span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">sin</span><span style=\"color:#1e754f;--shiki-dark:#4d9375\">(</span><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#C99076\">this</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">.</span><span style=\"color:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#BD976A\">orbitAngle</span><span style=\"color:#1e754f;--shiki-dark:#4d9375\">)</span><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91\"> 13.9</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91\">  5.1</span><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#BD976A\"> Math</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">.</span><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">sin</span><span style=\"color:#1e754f;--shiki-dark:#4d9375\">(</span><span style=\"color:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#BD976A\">Math</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">.</span><span style=\"color:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#BD976A\">PI</span><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#BD976A\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#1e754f;--shiki-dark:#4d9375\">)</span><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91\"> .45</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\">  -</span><span style=\"color:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91\">1.5</span><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#BD976A\"> Math</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">.</span><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">cos</span><span style=\"color:#1e754f;--shiki-dark:#4d9375\">(</span><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#C99076\">this</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">.</span><span style=\"color:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#BD976A\">orbitAngle</span><span style=\"color:#1e754f;--shiki-dark:#4d9375\">)</span><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91\"> 13.9</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#2993a3;--shiki-dark:#5eaab5\">)</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#C99076\">this</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">.</span><span style=\"color:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#BD976A\">camera</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">.</span><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665\">lookAt</span><span style=\"color:#2993a3;--shiki-dark:#5eaab5\">(</span><span style=\"color:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91\">0</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">,</span><span style=\"color:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91\"> .8</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">,</span><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91\">1.5</span><span style=\"color:#2993a3;--shiki-dark:#5eaab5\">)</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666\">;</span></span></code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"效果与边界\"><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#效果与边界\">#</a> 效果与边界</h2>\n<p>这个项目主要探索“怎样把降水强度表达得更直观”。它采用程序化雨景和风格化水面高光，弹起水滴使用正弦轨迹，不是完整的流体、碰撞或物理光照模拟。画面还原的是雨的视觉感受，不能从画面反推出精确降水量。</p>\n<p>小 / 中 / 大的视觉档位以 2.5 和 7.5 mm/h 分界，<strong>不等同于气象部门按累计雨量划分的小雨、中雨、大雨等级</strong>。博客里的时间全部是相对演示分钟，数据全部为模拟，没有地点对应关系，也不代表真实天气预测准确率。</p>\n<p>后续可以继续改善地面材质、水滴运动和不同雨势之间的层次，让雨景更自然。完整渲染代码已附在上方，本文的片段用于解释各个层次如何协作。</p>\n",
